py URL\nEmail\nPrint\nFacebook\nThreads\nX\nGraduate and Professional Degree Programs\nRequest information\napply today\nDrexel provides a comprehensive graduate education that includes research opportunities and access to state-of-the-art facilities and laboratories to produce the next generation of scholars, professionals, and leaders.\nWith over 120 graduate and professional programs across a variety of colleges and schools, you can pursue a master's or doctoral degree to advance your career or work to improve your professional standing by earning a certificate in your field. Programs are offered at all of our Philadelphia-area campuses, and many programs allow you to study part-time or online, providing the flexibility to earn your degree while working full-time.\nExplore Drexel's academic calendar to learn about start terms and end dates. Browse through our Course Catalog for detailed information regarding departments, majors, plans of study, and University policies. To learn more about the support services available to Drexel's graduate students, visit our Office of Graduate Studies.\nGraduate Programs Search\nTop\nConnect\nGet Started\nClose\nInfo For:\nStudents\nFamilies\nAlumni\nFaculty & Professional Staff\nRequest Info\nApply\nVisit\nMake a Gift\nDrexel University\n3141 Chestnut Street\nPhiladelphia, PA 19104\nView on Map\n215.895.2000\nEmergency\nContact\nPress\nCareers\nInfo For:\nStudents\nFamilies\nAlumni\nFaculty & Professional Staff\nFollow Drexel\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Drexel University. All rights reserved. Privacy & Legal\nFollow Drexel\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Drexel University. All rights reserved. Privacy & Legal", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://drexel.edu/academics/grad-professional-programs#main-content"], ["", "https://drexel.edu/"], ["News", "http://drexel.edu/news"], ["Events", "https://drexel.edu/events"], ["Make A Gift", "https://secureia.drexel.edu/s/1683/form/16/form.aspx?sid=1683&gid=2&pgid=477&cid=1122&appealcode=WEBDUMAI